ame="43b · Guardrails around an AI turn: input, evidence, output and memory"><mxGraphModel dx="0" dy="0" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2250" pageHeight="2726" background="#ffffff" adaptiveColors="none" conformance="Practical UML sequence subset; native draw.io figure styles" scopeDescription="43b · Guardrails around an AI turn: input, evidence, output and memory" semanticModel="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;43b-ai-guardrails&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;43b · Guardrails around an AI turn: input, evidence, output and memory&quot;,&quot;participants&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;conv&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Conversation Service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;AI Service&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;classifier&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Classifier model (optional)&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;external&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;retrieval&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Retrieval&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;llm&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Answer model&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;external&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mem&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Memory writers&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;service&quot;}],&quot;steps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Each of the four checks has its own mode (off · shadow · enforce) so it can be replayed on real traffic before it enforces; findings are content-free codes in the log and the Langfuse root output&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/domain/services/rag-guardrail/rag-guardrail.ts:45-69&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;conv&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ai.stream_question (message, optional photo)&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;synchCall&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/infrastructure/controller/ai.controller.ts:283-307&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;1 · Input: pattern check on the typed message, run before admission and before any model call&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/refuse-rag-input.use-case.ts:10-34&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;frame&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;opt&quot;,&quot;operands&quot;:[{&quot;guard&quot;:&quot;the patterns let the message through and the classifier is on&quot;,&quot;steps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;classifier&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Second opinion on the message (borderline only by default; one extra call; timeout 4 s fails open)&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;synchCall&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/classify-rag-input.use-case.ts:58-82&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;classifier&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Verdict with confidence; it can only add a refusal, never lift one&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;reply&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/classify-rag-input.use-case.ts:16-40&quot;]}]}]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;frame&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;alt&quot;,&quot;operands&quot;:[{&quot;guard&quot;:&quot;a high-severity finding and the input check enforces&quot;,&quot;steps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;conv&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Fixed refusal at once: no model slot, no retrieval, no memory write&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;reply&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/stream-chat.use-case.ts:66-90&quot;]}]},{&quot;guard&quot;:&quot;the message is allowed&quot;,&quot;steps&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;retrieval&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Retrieve evidence for the question&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;synchCall&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/infrastructure/adapters/langgraph-rag-chat-workflow.adapter.ts:374-398&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;2 · Evidence: a chunk with a high-severity injection finding is dropped before it reaches the prompt&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/domain/services/rag-guardrail/rag-guardrail.ts:90-114&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;retrieval&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kept chunks and the findings for the dropped ones&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;reply&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/screen-rag-result.use-case.ts:44-68&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;3 · Memory in the prompt: stored summaries and facts that carry a high-severity finding are left out&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/infrastructure/adapters/chat-prompt-builder.adapter.ts:4-28&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;llm&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Draft, verify and stream the answer&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;synchCall&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/stream-final-answer.use-case.ts:69-93&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;4 · Output: live text is held back 160 characters and screened as it grows; a leak is replaced by a fixed message and publishing stops&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/stream-final-answer.use-case.ts:82-106&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;conv&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Answer, or the fixed output refusal that does not say why&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;reply&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/screen-rag-result.use-case.ts:14-38&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;conv&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;ai.conversation_turn_completed (caption, answer, memory)&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;asynchSignal&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/conversation-service/src/application/use-cases/process-bot-reply.use-case.ts:115-139&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;message&quot;,&quot;from&quot;:&quot;ai&quot;,&quot;to&quot;:&quot;mem&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Summary and long-term memory writers&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;synchCall&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/update-conversation-memory.use-case.ts:86-110&quot;]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;5 · Memory write: text with a high-severity finding is never stored, so an attack that was answered once cannot persist&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/screen-rag-memory.use-case.ts:26-50&quot;]}]}]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;A guardrail failure never takes chat down: every check fails open and logs the error. Text from a failed check is not a reason to refuse.&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/ai-service/src/application/use-cases/screen-rag-memory.use-case.ts:45-50&quot;]}]}"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="life45" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 4;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#34A853;strokeWidth=1.2;"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1900" y="266" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1900" y="2626" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="life44" edge="1" parent="1" style="html=1;fon